        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2023-10-04T21:46:50.437Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had some Romper Room and Captain Kangaroo too, but I’m about as old as you can be and still be Gen X.  People at the other end of the gen might have missed them.</p>\n<p>But yes, LeVar Burton is indeed a treasure, long may he live (and prosper, of course).</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Jeysie\" data-post=\"20\" data-topic=\"30261\" data-full=\"true\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/48/1868_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Jeysie:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>We can throw Bob Ross in there too.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I didn’t see him till we finally got cable when I was in high school.  Rural pre-cable viewing options were pretty limited.</p>",
