        "created_at": "2023-10-05T01:26:32.964Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"FrivYeti\" data-post=\"14\" data-topic=\"30261\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/48/1919_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> FrivYeti:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Who is going to request the Guise &amp; Legacy join forces with the ghost of George Washington Carver to fight the Green Grosser’s Peril Peanuts story?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I am very here for Legacy fighting ghosts in any context.</p>",
