        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2026-02-06T15:27:35.193Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Turns out it was a typo the whole time, the Hessian mercenary was always just a Heedless Horseman.</p>\n<p>Man, I keep forgetting how good the Sleepy hollow movie was.  I’ve only seen it once and it deserves so much more.</p>\n<p><span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#notallhorsefeet</span></p>\n<p>“I do not fear any phantom!”</p>\n<p>I wonder if Strichniles is a creeper…</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\" data-post=\"5\" data-topic=\"30261\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A-Damned Re-Boo-taro, fantastic, October off to a perfect start.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Ghostopher was so good though!</p>",
